<tr><td>Absorbable</td><td><mark data-q="112-34">Polyglycolic acid</mark></td><td>Braided</td><td>Very low</td><td><mark data-q="112-34">Low</mark></td><td>Good</td><td><mark data-q="112-34"><strong class="ex-n">2 wks</strong></mark></td></tr>
<tr><td>Absorbable</td><td>Poliglecaprone 25</td><td>Monofilament</td><td>Low</td><td>Very low</td><td>Very good</td><td><strong class="ex-n">1 wk</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>Absorbable</td><td>Polyglyconate</td><td>Monofilament</td><td>Low</td><td>Very low</td><td>Very good</td><td><strong class="ex-n">1 mo</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>Absorbable</td><td><mark data-q="112-34">Polydioxanone（PDS）</mark></td><td>Monofilament</td><td>High</td><td><mark data-q="112-34">Very low</mark></td><td>Poor</td><td><mark data-q="112-34"><strong class="ex-n">1 mo</strong></mark></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 202-5，p.3716。</p>
<h3>Suture size（縫線粗細，USP）</h3>
<ul>
<li>皮膚手術多用 <strong class="ex-n">3-0 至 6-0</strong>；第一個數字越大線越細、tensile strength 越小。選能提供足夠強度的最細縫線。<span class="ex-ref">p.3716–3717</span></li>
</ul>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Anatomic site（部位）</th><th scope="col">Suture diameter（粗細）</th><th scope="col">Time to removal（拆線時間）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Eyelids</td><td>6-0</td><td><strong class="ex-n">5–7 days</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>Face and ears</td><td>5-0</td><td><strong class="ex-n">5–7 days</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>Neck</td><td>4-0、5-0</td><td><strong class="ex-n">7 days</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>Scalp</td><td>3-0、4-0</td><td><strong class="ex-n">7–14 days</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>Trunk and extremities</td><td>3-0、4-0</td><td><strong class="ex-n">10–14 days</strong>（高張力或癒合差處可更久）</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 202-6，p.3717；lower legs 等特別高張力處可留到 <strong class="ex-n">21 days</strong>，p.3720。</p>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="suturing-technique">
<h2>13. Suturing Technique, Staples &amp; Second Intention（縫合技術、釘皮與二度癒合）</h2>
<ul>
<li>理想縫合：精準對合與 <strong>wound edge eversion</strong>（癒合時會收縮，外翻才能得到平坦疤痕；不足則凹陷或變寬）；減少張力與 dead space；維持 cosmetic subunit 輪廓；避免 suture track marks。<span class="ex-ref">p.3717</span></li>
</ul>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Technique（技術）</th><th scope="col">Key points（重點）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Buried absorbable simple interrupted</td><td>減張並提供早期支撐；以 <strong>“heart-shaped”</strong> 方式置於深真皮與皮下（入針與最終出針點最深）達到外翻（Fig. 202-1）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Epidermal simple interrupted</td><td>精準對位；高張力處可分次間隔拆線；水腫與微循環影響較 running 少；可修正 “stepped” 高低差（高側淺縫、低側深縫）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Horizontal mattress</td><td>減張、止血、外翻；可作暫時 bridging suture；距傷口緣數 mm 或加 bolster 以減少 wound-edge necrosis</td></tr>
<tr><td>Half-buried horizontal mattress（Gillies corner stitch／3-point corner stitch）</td><td>M-plasty、V-Y plasty、rotation flap 的皮瓣尖端對角；減少干擾真皮血管叢 → 降低 flap tip necrosis</td></tr>
<tr><td>Vertical mattress</td><td>外翻、減少 dead space 與張力（buried dermal + epidermal 合體）；張力過大易壞死；要盡早拆，否則出現成對 track marks</td></tr>
<tr><td>Simple running</td><td>等厚、低張力（已有埋線時）；只打 2 個結、減少 track marks；適合 eyelids、ears、neck、scrotum 等薄皮與固定植皮；細部調整較難，薄鬆皮易皺縮切入</td></tr>
<tr><td>Running locking</td><td>中等張力、幫助止血（scalp）；比 simple running 強，但太緊或腫脹時 wound-edge necrosis 風險增加；用於不易內翻處</td></tr>
<tr><td>Running subcuticular</td><td>淺真皮的埋藏式連續縫合；縫線留置較久時減少 track marks；對合力不大，需先有深層埋線；可吸收（monofilament、nonreactive）或不可吸收（如 polypropylene）</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">p.3717–3719</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Staples</strong>：長傷口或極高張力；優點：快速、強度高、易拆、組織反應低、污染傷口感染可能較低；缺點：對合較不精準；常用於 <strong>scalp</strong>（不需剃髮、痕跡被頭髮遮住）。<span class="ex-ref">p.3719</span></li>
<li><strong>Second intention healing</strong>：小而淺、位於臉部 <strong>concave surfaces</strong> 的缺損，如 nasal root、temple、preauricular、耳的 fossae 與 conchal bowl、posterior helix、postauricular sulcus；也可用於 scalp 與軀幹四肢淺傷口。靠近 eyelid、nasal ala、lip 等 free margins 要預防收縮造成 ectropion、eclabium。<span class="ex-ref">p.3719–3720</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="postop-care">
<h2>14. Postoperative Care &amp; Follow-up（術後照護與回診）</h2>
<ul>
<li>Pressure bandage 保留 <strong class="ex-n">24–48 hours</strong>：petrolatum + nonadherent dressing + cotton，以膠帶加壓固定。<span class="ex-ref">p.3720</span></li>
<li>拆除壓迫敷料後：溫和肥皂與清水每天清洗 <strong class="ex-n">1–2 次</strong>，再塗 petrolatum、覆蓋 nonadherent dressing。</li>
<li><mark data-q="104-44">封閉（occluded）傷口 reepithelialization 與癒合比乾燥傷口快</mark>；petrolatum 惰性、無毒、不刺激、不致敏。</li>
<li>Petrolatum 優於 topical antibiotic ointments：後者 allergic contact dermatitis 風險高，且預防感染並不優於 petrolatum。</li>
<li><mark data-q="103-50">容易有 <em>Pseudomonas</em> 感染的部位（如 ear）可用稀醋酸（vinegar）清洗</mark>；hydrogen peroxide 可清除厚痂，但長期使用有組織毒性。</li>
<li>滲液多時可改用 gauze、films、hydrocolloids、hydrogels、alginates。</li>
<li>Suture removal：留越久越不易裂開，但 reepithelialization 會留下永久 track marks，需權衡；頭頸部血流好、張力小可早拆（見 Table 202-6）；lower legs 等高張力可留到 <strong class="ex-n">21 days</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.3720</span></li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>傷口不是越乾越好；保持濕潤、封閉才會較快上皮化，petrolatum 封閉也不會增加感染。</aside>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="early-complications">
<h2>15. Complications: Immediate Postoperative Period（術後早期併發症）</h2>
<h3>Infection（感染）</h3>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Organism（菌種）</th><th scope="col">Timing（發生時間）</th><th scope="col">Presentation（表現）</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><mark data-q="104-44"><em>Streptococcus pyogenes</em></mark></td><td><mark data-q="104-44"><strong class="ex-n">24–48 hours</strong></mark></td><td><mark data-q="104-44">Tender, expanding erythema（術區周圍擴大的壓痛紅斑）</mark></td></tr>
<tr><td><em>S. aureus</em></td><td><strong class="ex-n">2–5 days</strong></td><td>Erythema + purulent drainage</td></tr>
<tr><td><em>Mycobacterium fortuitum</em>、<em>M. chelonae</em>（少見）</td><td>術後數週</td><td>Pyogenic abscess、erythema、induration、sinus formation；可有 sporotrichoid spread</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">p.3720</p>
<ul>
<li>First-line：cephalexin <strong class="ex-n">500 mg</strong> PO <strong class="ex-n">3–4</strong> 次／日。<span class="ex-ref">p.3720</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="105-45">Penicillin allergy 或 MRSA：doxycycline <strong class="ex-n">100 mg</strong> PO BID</mark>。</li>
<li>第一線治療無效時做 wound culture 與藥敏。</li>
</ul>
<h3>Contact dermatitis（接觸性皮膚炎）</h3>
<ul>
<li>Neomycin、bacitracin 等抗生素藥膏的 allergic contact dermatitis 並不少見；表現為塗抹範圍的鮮紅 erythema、edema、vesiculation，<strong>pruritus 比 pain 常見</strong>。<span class="ex-ref">p.3720–3721</span></li>
<li>也可由 iodinates、chlorhexidine 或敷料黏膠引起（allergic 或 irritant）。</li>
</ul>
<h3>Pain（疼痛）</h3>
<ul>
<li><mark data-q="103-50,106-06">術後疼痛通常輕微，以減少活動、冰敷減腫與 <strong>acetaminophen</strong> 控制</mark>。<span class="ex-ref">p.3721</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="103-50">大範圍或複雜修補可短期使用 analgesics；acetaminophen 與 ibuprofen 交替，效果與 acetaminophen + codeine 相近</mark>。</li>
</ul>
<h3>Bleeding and hematoma（出血與血腫）</h3>
<ul>
<li>Epinephrine 代謝後可能出血增加；先請病人持續用力壓迫；二度癒合傷口可找到出血點 hyfrecation。<span class="ex-ref">p.3721</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="103-50"><strong>&lt;24 hours</strong> 發現的 hematoma：拆開必要縫線、找出出血點，以 hyfrecation 或結紮止血後重新縫合</mark>，最終外觀通常不受影響。</li>
<li><strong>&gt;24 hours</strong>：可用 large-bore needle 抽吸；復發則拆線止血；窄幅切除傷口邊緣後重縫可改善結果。</li>
</ul>
<h3>Necrosis（組織壞死）</h3>
<ul>
<li>多見於 skin graft 或 flap；primary closure 較少，除非表皮縫線極緊。<span class="ex-ref">p.3721</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="103-50">Intrinsic factors：excessive wound tension</mark>、hematoma、infection。</li>
<li>Graft necrosis：植皮太厚（養分供應不足）、shearing forces 或外傷。</li>
<li><mark data-q="103-50">Flap necrosis：pedicle 太小、flap 太薄、過度 kinking、leading edge 張力過大</mark>。</li>
<li>Extrinsic factors：血管或心臟功能不良、照射過的皮膚、控制不良的 diabetes、<mark data-q="106-17">smoking 與 nicotine（vasoconstriction、傷口血流下降）</mark>。</li>
</ul>
<h3>Dehiscence（傷口裂開）</h3>
<ul>
<li>原因：高張力 primary closure、感染、壞死。<span class="ex-ref">p.3721</span></li>
<li><mark data-q="105-26"><strong>&lt;24 hours</strong>：直接重縫，不需修整邊緣；<strong>&gt;48 hours</strong>：先切除約 <strong class="ex-n">1 mm</strong> 正常皮膚邊緣再重縫</mark>。</li>
<li>合併感染或壞死：改採 second intention healing。</li>
<li>高張力處（back）與癒合慢處（lower leg）可將表皮縫線留 <strong class="ex-n">2–3 weeks</strong> 降低裂開。</li>
</ul>
<aside class="ex-trap"><strong>易錯</strong>24 小時內的 hematoma 要打開止血再縫，不是只靠加壓；超過 24 小時才考慮針抽。</aside>
</section>

<section class="ex-note" id="late-complications">
<h2>16. Complications: Distant Postoperative Period（術後晚期併發症）</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Milia／keratinous cysts</strong>：縫線處或旁邊；needle incision + comedone extractor；不易移除或復發時切片排除腫瘤復發。<span class="ex-ref">p.3721–3722</span></li>
<li><strong>Suture track marks</strong>：縫線因張力切入組織，或留置太久而上皮化。<mark data-q="105-26">以 <strong>polypropylene</strong> 對合（拉伸後具 plasticity，減少切入腫脹組織）</mark>、running suture（張力平均）或 running subcuticular 可減少；形成後 <strong class="ex-n">1–2 months</strong> 內可用 dermabrasion 改善。<span class="ex-ref">p.3722–3723</span></li>
<li><strong>Depressed／furrow-like scar</strong>：皮脂腺多的部位（如 nasal tip）易撕裂分離；切除、undermining 後以埋線加 vertical 或 horizontal mattress 重縫，使用 <strong class="ex-n">5-0</strong> 或更粗的縫線以充分外翻。<span class="ex-ref">p.3723–3724</span></li>
<li><strong>Spread（widened）scar</strong>：傷口緣張力大，如 scalp、upper trunk、shoulders、upper arms。<span class="ex-ref">p.3724</span></li>
<li><strong>Spitting suture</strong>（buried suture extrusion）：約術後 <strong class="ex-n">3–4 weeks</strong>，局部紅腫、有時無菌膿疱；在傷口緣剪掉露出的線並輕輕引流。<span class="ex-ref">p.3724</span></li>
<li><strong>Erythema</strong>：通常 <strong class="ex-n">3–12 months</strong> 內改善，需防曬；日曬可延長紅斑或造成色素沉著（深膚色）。<strong>Telangiectasia</strong> 常見，女性可能較多（estrogenic effects）；可用 <strong class="ex-n">585–595-nm</strong> pulsed-dye laser 或 <strong class="ex-n">532-nm</strong> KTP laser。</li>
<li><strong>Hypopigmentation</strong>：紅斑消退時出現，植皮也可見；rosacea 紅色背景下更明顯，可用雷射處理紅斑以減少對比。</li>
<li><strong>Sensory anesthesia</strong>：flap 或 graft 後常見，多於 <strong class="ex-n">3–18 months</strong> 恢復；切斷 supraorbital nerve → 上眼瞼中央、同側前額與頭皮感覺下降；在 <strong>Erb point</strong> 切斷 greater auricular nerve → 同側耳下部可能永久麻木。</li>
<li><strong>Motor function loss</strong>：麻藥暫時影響 temporal 或 marginal mandibular branch of facial nerve（術前須告知）；切斷則永久；另需小心 spinal accessory nerve。<span class="ex-ref">p.3724</span></li>
</ul>
<h3>Hypertrophic scar vs. keloid（肥厚性疤痕與蟹足腫）</h3>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Feature</th><th scope="col">Hypertrophic scar</th><th scope="col">Keloid</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Incidence</td><td>Common</td><td>Uncommon</td></tr>
<tr><td>Race</td><td>All</td><td>Usually Fitzpatrick skin phototypes <strong class="ex-n">III–VI</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>Preceding injury</td><td>Yes</td><td>Sometimes</td></tr>
<tr><td>Location</td><td>任何部位，尤其垂直最大張力線的 upper trunk、shoulders、upper arms</td><td>Earlobes 與 trunk 常見；central face 罕見</td></tr>
<tr><td>Growth</td><td>Within initial wound boundaries</td><td>Beyond boundaries（finger-like projections）</td></tr>
<tr><td>Improves with time</td><td>Typically</td><td>Typically not</td></tr>
<tr><td>Recurs with excision</td><td>Typically not</td><td>Typically</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">Table 202-7，p.3724。</p>
<ul>
<li>治療：intralesional triamcinolone acetonide，起始 <strong class="ex-n">10 mg/mL</strong>，需要時增加到 <strong class="ex-n">40 mg/mL</strong>；silicone gel／sheeting 可減少厚度與紅斑，但證據有限；其他效果不一：surgical excision、intralesional 5-FU 或 interferon-α、cryosurgery、radiotherapy、laser。<span class="ex-ref">p.3723</span></li>
</ul>
</section>
